    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Our Discord!</h2><br><br>Aquium aims to create a unique opportunity for players to create a beautiful aquarium in a calming and relaxing world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own Aquarium!</h2>Use a diverse collection of various objects from rocks &amp; plants to fantasy buildings to craft a special aquarium for your fishes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746620/extras/f8a27d3d0a253a15fa7d1b1f46ec455a.avif?t=1716200689\" width=620 height=322 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch wild fishes!</h2>Aquium allows you to catch fishes in the world --both realistic and fantastical-- to add them to your customized aquarium!<br>You may also sell the fish to obtain gold, which can be used to buy customization options and upgrade your gear.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746620/extras/ebdaf87cb289257ab7bafe479fbde73b.avif?t=1716200689\" width=620 height=322 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize &amp; buy your ship!</h2>You can buy new ships of different speeds, storage sizes, etc., and customize them to your liking!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746620/extras/ed0f0453279b0eef85617da691b5e30a.avif?t=1716200689\" width=620 height=322 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your fishing gear!</h2>Use gold to upgrade your own fishing gear, which may assist increasing in the number of fish to be caught at once, increasing rarity percentages, etc.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please Note:</h2>Aquium is not an aquarium or fishing simulation experience by any means and is meant for casual play. If you are looking for aspects like pH levels, water temperature, water types, etc., please note that this game will not include these aspects.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Our Discord!</h2><br><br>Aquium aims to create a unique opportunity for players to create a beautiful aquarium in a calming and relaxing world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own Aquarium!</h2>Use a diverse collection of various objects from rocks &amp; plants to fantasy buildings to craft a special aquarium for your fishes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746620/extras/f8a27d3d0a253a15fa7d1b1f46ec455a.avif?t=1716200689\" width=620 height=322 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch wild fishes!</h2>Aquium allows you to catch fishes in the world --both realistic and fantastical-- to add them to your customized aquarium!<br>You may also sell the fish to obtain gold, which can be used to buy customization options and upgrade your gear.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746620/extras/ebdaf87cb289257ab7bafe479fbde73b.avif?t=1716200689\" width=620 height=322 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize &amp; buy your ship!</h2>You can buy new ships of different speeds, storage sizes, etc., and customize them to your liking!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746620/extras/ed0f0453279b0eef85617da691b5e30a.avif?t=1716200689\" width=620 height=322 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your fishing gear!</h2>Use gold to upgrade your own fishing gear, which may assist increasing in the number of fish to be caught at once, increasing rarity percentages, etc.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please Note:</h2>Aquium is not an aquarium or fishing simulation experience by any means and is meant for casual play. If you are looking for aspects like pH levels, water temperature, water types, etc., please note that this game will not include these aspects.",
    "short_description": "Aquium is a casual single-player aquarium diorama designer where you can create your own underwater aquarium &amp; relax with your fish. Embark on your customized ship to navigate the ocean, collect both real and fantastical fish, and add them to your uniquely designed aquarium!",
